   5:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_gpio.c ****   * @brief   GPIO HAL module driver.
   6:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *          functionalities of the General Purpose Input/Output (GPIO) peripheral:
   8:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
   9:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *           + IO operation functions
  10:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *
  11:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_gpio.c ****   ******************************************************************************
